OL,3,GNEWSAUniversity's third staff exit
OL,4,Ascheme in three years
OL,5,
OL,6,FA university is running a voluntary
OL,7,Fseverance scheme for the third year
OL,8,Frunning after saying it was in a
OL,9,F"secure financial position".
OL,11,FDurham University said the scheme would
OL,12,Fhelp ensure it built up the "sustained
OL,13,Ffinancial capacity" required to invest
OL,14,Fin its priorities. It said the plan did
OL,15,Fnot come with savings targets.
OL,17,FHowever, the University and College
OL,18,FUnion (UCU) questioned why the
OL,19,Funiversity was running the scheme if it
OL,20,Fwas in a healthy financial position.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
