OL,3,GNEWSAUniversity's third staff exit
OL,4,Ascheme in three years
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe university said its costs were
OL,7,Fprojected to rise faster than its
OL,8,Fincome and the move would help maintain
OL,9,Fa "sound financial position".
